CM_ BO_ 1025 "Fixed WS22 classic CAN: little-endian IEEE-754 floats; vendor units and wire layout are exempt from team scaling. All WS22 frames have eight data bytes.";
CM_ SG_ 1025 MC_MotorCurrentSetpoint "Vendor current fraction: 0.0 to 1.0, never 0 to 100.";
CM_ SG_ 1025 MC_MotorVelocitySetpoint "Signed velocity setpoint; reverse requires negative rpm. Operational limits are controller settings, not wire limits.";
