CM_ SG_ 1026 MC_MotorPowerSetpoint "Vendor current fraction: 0.0 to 1.0, never 0 to 100.";
CM_ BO_ 1027 "Defined WS22 reset trigger: eight unused data bytes, transmitted as zeros.";
