CM_ BO_ 1060 "Fixed WS22 classic CAN: little-endian IEEE-754 floats; vendor units and wire layout are exempt from team scaling. All WS22 frames have eight data bytes.";
CM_ SG_ 1060 MC_PhaseCurrentC "RMS current in motor Phase C.";
